# Repository-wide line endings: store LF.
#
# History: CRLF and LF were mixed, which made an ordinary merge rewrite a whole
# file with no content change (src/L13_namespace/bump_spine_iter.rs in 66da950),
# hiding real edits inside tens of thousands of phantom diff lines. Pin every
# text file to LF in the repository (and in the working tree) so that cannot
# recur.
* text=auto eol=lf
